issue.body:
This is a very similar story to issue #6116 

If you try to create a `whereHas` query inside a global scope it will loop infinitely till eventually giving you an out of memory error.

``` php
    public function apply(Builder $builder)
    {
        $builder->whereHas('flags', function($q) use ($user)
        {
            $q->whereReporterId($user->id);
        });
    }
...
```

Basically it will get to line 607 in the [Eloquent/Builder.php](https://github.com/laravel/framework/blob/4.2/src/Illuminate/Database/Eloquent/Builder.php#L607) and that will cause it continuously create new queries.

I do not have a fix yet, does anyone else? :)
